        "change_summary": "Replaced the initial-level-set copy with a graph-harmonic potential-field inversion: signed label sources (0/1/contact) are interpolated over the grid by a weighted Dirichlet energy plus a weak prior from the initial level set. A small bounded set of regularization strengths and exact-conditioning variants is solved, and the candidate minimizing the public objective proxy (reconstructed signed distance, logistic + contact + optional sketch) is returned. Includes a guaranteed sign-changing finite fallback.",
