        "rationale": "The measured parent copied the weak initial geometry and scored loss_total 1248.84 with 884 label mismatches and contact RMSE 10.03. The public objective only constrains observed labels and contact positions through the zero isosurface, so I used potential-field interpolation to satisfy those constraints smoothly instead of relying on the initial blob. On the public 3D case the new solver runs in ~1.4 s, has 0 label mismatches, contact RMSE 0, and loss_total 129.96 (drillhole 28.54, outcrop 101.42), a large measured improvement. The internal candidate selection is data-driven and bounded by the provided wall-time budget, and the public selfcheck fixture passes."
