        "change_summary": "Kept the distance-transform, KDE and harmonic candidate families and added local Gaussian margin corrections: for the best smoothed signed-distance field, the solver reconstructs the signed-distance proxy, identifies observed labels still contributing non-negligible logistic cost, and adds sign-aligned Gaussian bumps over a small grid of thresholds, radii and amplitudes. Candidate selection remains the exact public-objective proxy within the wall-time budget.",
